/-!
# Family continuation theory

Umbrella for the route "a zero-free half-plane by continuing the reciprocals of a family of
`L`-functions across its rightmost zeros, then from a half-plane to the line".

* Additive columns of residue characters: the correlation of two columns is one term; the
  weighted second moment over the rows is a multiplicative form in the frequency; at the
  frequencies on which the characters are trivial the terms add without cancellation.
-/
